          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2\\sqrt{98}}{7}&=\\frac{2\\sqrt{49}\\sqrt{2}}{7}\\\\&=\\frac{14\\sqrt{2}}{7}\\\\&=2\\sqrt{2}\\end{align*}$$",
